{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":14000,"raw":false,"start_index":0,"url":"https://freedom.press/issues/biden/"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://freedom.press/issues/biden/:\n1. ## [Biden’s press freedom legacy: Empty words and hypocrisy](/issues/bidens-press-freedom-legacy-empty-words-and-hypocrisy/)\n\n   ![President Joe Biden waves to journalists as he walks alongside First Lady Jill Biden while arriving at the White House Jan. 2, 2025](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP25002644236675_1.2e16d0ba.fill-451x254.format-jpeg.jpg)\n2. ## [Justice Dept. and Julian Assange reach plea deal in case that threatens press freedom](/issues/justice-dept-and-julian-assange-reach-plea-deal-in-case-that-threatens-press-freedom/)\n\n   ![Julian Assange's faces the camera, with his head turned slightly](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/assange_2.original_1.2e16d0ba.fill-451x254.format-jpeg.jpg)\n3. ## [‘Silence is complicity’: Why US should stop enabling Israel’s attacks on press](/issues/silence-is-complicity-why-us-should-stop-enabling-israels-attacks-on-press/)\n\n   ![Al Jazeera journalist Wael Dahdouh mourns his son Hamza, who also worked for Al Jazeera and who was killed in an Israeli airstrike in Rafah, Gaza Strip, Sunday, Jan. 7, 2024 -AP24007423956242](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/ap_gaza_4.2e16d0ba.fill-451x254.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n1. ![North Carolina Supreme Court Justice Paul Newby](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP24192612192700.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n2. ![President-elect Donald Trump and Melania Trump are greeted by President Joe Biden and first lady Jill Biden, upon their arrival at the White House, Monday, Jan. 20, 2025, in Washington.](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP25020544089520.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n   ## [Thanks for citing us, House Republicans. Now do something](/issues/thanks-for-citing-us-house-republicans-now-do-something/)\n\n   [Trump](/issues/dont-let-trump-destroy-press-freedom/)•[Article](/issues/?content-type=article)\n\n\n   GOP lawmakers apparently agree with our criticisms of the Biden administration’s press freedom policies. We reminded them that Trump’s been even worse\n3. ![A photo of a reporter having a confrontation with police](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP25168644577014.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n   ## [Recording police is not ‘violence’](/issues/recording-police-is-not-violence/)\n\n   [ICE](/issues/hold-ice-accountable/)•[Newsletter](/issues/?content-type=newsletter)\n\n\n   Plus: Will secret law prevail in drug boat massacre?\n4. ![Tim Burke’s home newsroom](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/Burke_newsroom.2e16d0b.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n   ## [A perfect setup to criminalize journalism](/issues/a-perfect-setup-to-criminalize-journalism/)\n\n   [Biden](/issues/biden/)•[Article](/issues/?content-type=article)\n\n\n   Biden’s Tim Burke prosecution will help Trump criminalize the reporting of corporate secrets\n5. ![Democratic Sen. Mark Warner greets Director of National Intelligence nominee Tulsi Gabbard at her Jan. 30 confirmation hearing.](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP25030580643184.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n   ## [A dangerous time to attack whistleblowers](/issues/a-dangerous-time-to-attack-whistleblowers/)\n\n   [Whistleblowers](/issues/defend-whistleblowers/)•[Newsletter](/issues/?content-type=newsletter)\n\n\n   Plus: A perfect setup to criminalize reporting of corporate secrets\n6. ![TikTok users live stream outside the Supreme Court during Jan. 10 arguments over the law to ban the platform.](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP25017532052442.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n7. ![Journalist Sam Husseini being forcibly removed from Secretary of State Antony Blinken's news conference.](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/Screenshot_2025-01-17_.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n   ## [Biden administration plays into Trump’s hands by roughing up journalist](/issues/biden-administration-plays-into-trumps-hands-by-roughing-up-journalist/)\n\n   [Israel/Gaza](/issues/israelgaza/)•[Article](/issues/?content-type=article)\n\n\n   Administration could have maintained decorum by not constantly ducking questions about Israel-Gaza war\n8. ![RT’s office in Moscow](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP17319418649121.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n   ## [Declassify RT records so the public can vet administration’s claims](/the-classifieds/declassify-rt-records-so-the-public-can-vet-administrations-claims/)\n\n   [Biden](/issues/biden/)•[Article](/the-classifieds/?content-type=article)\n\n\n   Letting the public see the actual documents would strengthen Biden administration's declassification efforts\n9. ![Screenshot - Senate Select Committee on Intelligence’s Report of the Central Intelligence Agency’s Detention and Interrogation Program](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/Screenshot_2024-09-10_.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n   ## [Biden should declassify Senate report on CIA torture program](/the-classifieds/biden-should-declassify-senate-report-on-cia-torture-program/)\n\n   [Secrecy](/the-classifieds/secrecy/)•[Article](/the-classifieds/?content-type=article)\n\n\n   Release would help counter growing evidence that the agency has become too powerful for oversight\n10. ![Democratic presidential nominee Vice President Kamala Harris talks to the media in Michigan on Aug. 8, 2024.](https://media.freedom.press/media/images/AP24222623648749.2e16d0ba.fill-330x220.format-jpeg.jpg)\n\n    ## [Harris is just the latest internet-era politician to stonewall the press](/issues/harris-is-just-the-latest-internet-era-politician-to-stonewall-the-press/)\n\n    [Media Funding](/issues/media-funding/)•[Article](/issues/?content-type=article)\n\n\n    Political candidates think the pros of avoiding journalists outweigh the cons. The only people who can change that are journalists themselves"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
